{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LHB4NnAMG6bxthPwmThTPo","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 01: Theme end-to-end: System mode with profile field\n2\t\n3\t**Blocked by:** None\n4\t**Status:** ready-for-agent\n5\t\n6\tAdd a `themePreference` profile field (default \"system\"), a theme control on the Settings page, and live OS tracking applied before first paint.\n7\t\n8\t## Acceptance Criteria\n9\t- [ ] A user with no saved preference sees the theme that matches their OS, with no flash on load, and it updates live when the OS setting changes.\n10\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbb1","uuid":"f08c4ecf-2c36-470f-b8de-a08402e57300","timestamp":"2026-09-24T02:41:29.357Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"«WORKING_AREA»/issues/01-theme-end-to-end-system-mode.md","content":"# 01: Theme end-to-end: System mode with profile field\n\n**Blocked by:** None\n**Status:** ready-for-agent\n\nAdd a `themePreference` profile field (default \"system\"), a theme control on the Settings page, and live OS tracking applied before first paint.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A user with no saved preference sees the theme that matches their OS, with no flash on load, and it updates live when the OS setting changes.\n","numLines":10,"startLine":1,"totalLines":10}}}
